{
    "chapter_num": 2,
    "verses_count": 25,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Moses Is Born"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And a man of the house of Levi went and took "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as wife"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a daughter of Levi. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the woman conceived and bore a son. And when she saw that he "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a beautiful "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "child,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " she hid him three months. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But when she could no longer hide him, she took an ark of bulrushes for him, daubed it with asphalt and pitch, put the child in it, and laid "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the reeds by the river’s bank. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And his sister stood afar off, to know what would be done to him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the daughter of Pharaoh came down to bathe at the river. And her maidens walked along the riverside; and when she saw the ark among the reeds, she sent her maid to get it. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when she opened "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " she saw the child, and behold, the baby wept. So she had compassion on him, and said, “This is one of the Hebrews’ children.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then his sister said to Pharaoh’s daughter, “Shall I go and call a nurse for you from the Hebrew women, that she may nurse the child for you?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Pharaoh’s daughter said to her, “Go.” So the maiden went and called the child’s mother. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Pharaoh’s daughter said to her, “Take this child away and nurse him for me, and I will give "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your wages.” So the woman took the child and nursed him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the child grew, and she brought him to Pharaoh’s daughter, and he became her son. So she called his name "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb. Mosheh, lit. Drawn Out"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Moses, saying, “Because I drew him out of the water.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Moses Flees to Midian"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now it came to pass in those days, when Moses was grown, that he went out to his brethren and looked at their burdens. And he saw an Egyptian beating a Hebrew, one of his brethren. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So he looked this way and that way, and when he saw no one, he killed the Egyptian and hid him in the sand. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when he went out the second day, behold, two Hebrew men were fighting, and he said to the one who did the wrong, “Why are you striking your companion?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he said, “Who made you a prince and a judge over us? Do you intend to kill me as you killed the Egyptian?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Moses feared and said, “Surely this thing is known!” "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When Pharaoh heard of this matter, he sought to kill Moses. But Moses fled from "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "the presence of Pharaoh"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the face of Pharaoh and dwelt in the land of Midian; and he sat down by a well."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the priest of Midian had seven daughters. And they came and drew water, and they filled the troughs to water their father’s flock. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the shepherds came and drove them away; but Moses stood up and helped them, and watered their flock."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When they came to Reuel"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Jethro, Ex. 3:1"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " their father, he said, “How "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is it that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you have come so soon today?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they said, “An Egyptian delivered us from the hand of the shepherds, and he also drew enough water for us and watered the flock.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So he said to his daughters, “And where "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " he? Why "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you have left the man? Call him, that he may eat bread.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Moses was content to live with the man, and he gave Zipporah his daughter to Moses. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And she bore "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a son. He called his name Gershom,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Stranger There"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for he said, “I have been a "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "sojourner, temporary resident"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "stranger in a foreign land.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now it happened in the process of time that the king of Egypt died. Then the children of Israel groaned because of the bondage, and they cried out; and their cry came up to God because of the bondage. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So God heard their groaning, and God remembered His covenant with Abraham, with Isaac, and with Jacob. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And God looked upon the children of Israel, and God acknowledged "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}